			"date": "2023-11-28T16:26:09.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I’m realizing slowly that I’ve bought into this brand of hype. Working on how to re-orient. Blood in the Machine (book) was an energizing wake up call.</p>",
